              <a href="/data_center/cytogenetic#rn-maps">RN Maps</a>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Chromosome Matrix 1-10 Section -->
  <section id="map-chromosomes" aria-labelledby="map-chromosomes-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="map-chromosomes-title">Chromosomes</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="map-chr-grid" aria-label="Maize chromosomes 1 through 10">
      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 1</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 1</h3>
        <p>Largest maize chromosome; over 12,000 bin-mapped loci.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64489">Bins 1 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40028">UMC 98 1 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40028&amp;map2=940880">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 2</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 2</h3>
        <p>Over 9,600 loci mapped across genetic and physical frameworks.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64501">Bins 2 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40030">UMC 98 2 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40030&amp;map2=940881">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 3</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 3</h3>
        <p>Nearly 9,000 loci; comprehensive recombinant inbred mapping.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64505">Bins 3 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40031">UMC 98 3 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40031&amp;map2=940882">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 4</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 4</h3>
        <p>Over 9,000 loci; classical phenotypic markers and SSR maps.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64506">Bins 4 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40032">UMC 98 4 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40032&amp;map2=940883">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 5</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 5</h3>
        <p>Over 9,300 loci mapped with high-density SNP panels.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64507">Bins 5 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40033">UMC 98 5 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40033&amp;map2=940884">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 6</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 6</h3>
        <p>Nucleolar organizer region &#40;NOR&#41; and satellite chromosome.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64508">Bins 6 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40034">UMC 98 6 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40034&amp;map2=940885">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 7</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 7</h3>
        <p>Over 6,300 mapped loci; extensive QTL mapping records.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64509">Bins 7 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40035">UMC 98 7 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40035&amp;map2=940886">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 8</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 8</h3>
        <p>Over 7,100 loci mapped across diverse mapping populations.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64510">Bins 8 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40036">UMC 98 8 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40036&amp;map2=940887">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 9</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 9</h3>
        <p>Classic genetics model; FSU cytogenetic FISH integration.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64511">Bins 9 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40037">UMC 98 9 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40037&amp;map2=940888">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="map-chr-card">
        <span class="map-chr-badge">Chr 10</span>
        <h3>Chromosome 10</h3>
        <p>Includes abnormal chromosome 10 &#40;Ab10&#41; meiotic drive locus.</p>
        <div class="map-chr-actions">
          <a href="/data_center/map/64512">Bins 10 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/data_center/map/40029">UMC 98 10 &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/compare_maps?map1=40029&amp;map2=940889">Compare &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Map Collections & Tools Section -->
  <section id="map-collections" aria-labelledby="map-collections-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="map-collections-title">Collections</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-card-grid map-collection-grid">
      <article class="mgdb-card">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-ok">Interactive Tool</span>
        <h3>Compare Two Maps</h3>
        <p>Side-by-side interactive comparison of locus orders, recombination distances, and syntenic inversions.</p>
        <a href="/compare_maps">Launch Map Comparator <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-card">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-info">Whole-Genome</span>
        <h3>Complete Map Across All Chromosomes</h3>
        <p>View all 10 chromosome sets together for composite maps such as IBM2 Neighbors and UMC 98.</p>
        <a href="/displaycompletemaprecord.cgi?id=64489">View Complete Map <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-card">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-warn">Bin Coordinates</span>
        <h3>Bin Viewer Tool</h3>
        <p>Search and browse core bin markers &#40;CBMs&#41; and bin boundaries across the maize genome.</p>
        <a href="/bin_viewer">Open Bin Viewer <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-card">
        <span class="mgdb-pill">Cytogenetics</span>
        <h3>Cytogenetic &amp; FISH Maps</h3>
        <p>Fluorescence in situ hybridization &#40;FISH&#41; chromosome physical maps and B chromosome breakpoints.</p>
        <a href="/data_center/cytogenetic">Explore Cytogenetic Maps <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-card">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-ok">SNP Comparison</span>
        <h3>SNPversity Tool</h3>
        <p>Search for SNPs and compare diversity patterns across thousands of inbred lines.</p>
        <a href="/snpversity">Launch SNPversity <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <!-- The "Map vs Genome Incongruencies" card stood here until 2026-09-04.
           /incongruency was built on B73 RefGen_v2 and was retired; it now
           redirects to this hub, so the card would have linked the page it sits
           on. -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bulk Downloads Section -->
  <section id="map-downloads" aria-labelledby="map-downloads-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="map-downloads-title">Downloads</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="map-download-grid" aria-label="Map downloads">
      <article class="map-download-card">
        <div class="map-download-header">
          <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-ok">Full TSV</span>
          <h3>Tabulated Map Catalog</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Complete curated catalog of all 2,100+ maps with identifiers, chromosomes, coordinate units, authors, and locus counts.</p>
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" href="/search/map/map_search_api.php?format=tsv">Download Maps TSV <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="map-download-card">
        <div class="map-download-header">
          <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-info">CSV Export</span>
          <h3>Tabulated Map CSV</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Comma-separated export of map records suitable for Excel, Python Pandas, and R bioinformatics pipelines.</p>
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" href="/search/map/map_search_api.php?format=csv">Download Maps CSV <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="map-download-card">
        <div class="map-download-header">
          <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-warn">Bin Coordinates</span>
          <h3>Bin Coordinates Archive</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Standardized maize core bin coordinates and boundary locus markers across all 10 chromosomes.</p>
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" href="/data_center/map/64489">View Reference Bins <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── References ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="map-references" aria-labelledby="map-references-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="map-references-title">References</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-ref-list">
      $(reference_cards)
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Metrics and the top map series figure -->
  <section id="map-statistics" aria-labelledby="map-statistics-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="map-statistics-title">Metrics</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-metric-grid">
      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-green">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>Curated Maps</h3>
          <span class="mgdb-metric-badge">Frameworks</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(metric_maps)</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">Active curated genetic, bin, and physical maps.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-amber">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>Mapped Loci</h3>
          <span class="mgdb-metric-badge">Coordinates</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(metric_loci)</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">Positioned genetic loci, markers, and QTLs.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-blue">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>Chromosomes &amp; LGs</h3>
          <span class="mgdb-metric-badge">Linkage</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(metric_chrs)</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">Chromosomes 1–10, B chromosome, and organellar genomes.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-burgundy">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>Mapping Publications</h3>
          <span class="mgdb-metric-badge">Literature</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(metric_pubs)</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">Peer-reviewed publications linked to mapping studies.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="map-chart-panel">
      <figure class="mgdb-figure mgdb-map-figure-wide">
        <h3>Top 10 maize maps by total mapped markers</h3>
        <p>Total unique markers and genetic loci positioned across chromosomes 1&ndash;10 for each map series.</p>
        <div class="mgdb-chart" id="map-chr-chart" role="img"
             aria-label="Horizontal bar chart of total markers across chromosomes 1 through 10 for the top 10 maize map series"
             data-labels="$(chart_labels)" data-values="$(chart_values)">
          <div class="mgdb-chart-fallback">Loading top map marker breakdown&hellip;</div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>$(chart_caption)</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related Resources Section -->
  <section id="map-related" class="mgdb-hub-related" aria-labelledby="map-related-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="map-related-title">Related resources</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-resource-panel">
      <div class="mgdb-resource-list">
        <a href="/handyref">
          <strong>Genetic map guide</strong>
          <span>What each map set is, how it was made, and how many loci it places</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/data_center/marker">
          <strong>Molecular Marker &amp; Probe Center</strong>
          <span>Over 771,000 marker records with mapped chromosome bin positions and gel assays</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/genome">
          <strong>Genome Data Hub</strong>
          <span>160 hosted genome assemblies across 31 maize and wild relative species</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/data_center/variation">
          <strong>Variations &amp; Alleles Data Hub</strong>
          <span>Over 1.7 million curated variations, gene mutations, and allele descriptors</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/data_center/stock">
          <strong>Stock Center &amp; Germplasm</strong>
          <span>Curated genetic stocks, mutant alleles, and NAM founder inbred lines</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/data_center/cytogenetic">
          <strong>Cytogenetic Data Hub</strong>
          <span>Chromosome FISH coordinates, translocation breakpoints, and karyotypes</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
)
